# ◈ packages.graphics.list — graphics / display stack
#
# ASSUMPTION (flag if wrong): Wayland-minimal, not Xorg. Rationale — AthanorOS
# is already non-systemd/musl/llvm and minimalism-first, and this stack only
# needs to run Calamares fullscreen on the live ISO, not a general desktop.
# `cage` is a single-application kiosk compositor built exactly for that:
# launch one Wayland client fullscreen, nothing else running.
#
# `seatd` replaces systemd-logind/elogind for seat and session management
# (VT switching, device access) without pulling in either systemd or the
# elogind compatibility shim — matches the existing OpenRC-only design.
#
# If you'd rather target Xorg instead (more battle-tested with older
# Calamares/KPMcore releases, heavier stack): swap this file's xorg-server +
# xf86-input-libinput + a minimal WM in for the wayland/cage/seatd entries
# below, and drop qtwayland from packages.calamares.list.

media-libs/mesa                   use:llvm,wayland,vulkan,-X
x11-libs/libdrm
x11-libs/pixman
media-libs/libglvnd
media-libs/vulkan-loader
dev-libs/wayland
dev-libs/wayland-protocols
gui-libs/wlroots
gui-apps/cage
sys-auth/seatd
sys-libs/libseat
media-libs/fontconfig
media-libs/freetype
media-fonts/noto
